e sale price of the table is $$48.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508983 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229116 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e5d92700-fe95-5d2c-8b25-5b6e3af31411" :knowledge-point/title "Applying a Percentage Decrease: Word Problems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08ba13fe-1d0b-507b-85bb-128d69277956" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$74.25$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508400} {:answer/id #uuid "0fc34084-dac6-528b-9bab-3c95b340ec89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$71.50$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508413} {:answer/id #uuid "18ab41f3-9e7c-549d-8e33-45a4d949c8b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$73.00$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508426} {:answer/id #uuid "5cfcbd7c-3cad-5dc2-9e79-693fbe4c4b98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$70.00$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508528} {:answer/id #uuid "a18f0694-e14d-5621-a0cd-e736598ab64d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$72.25$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508633}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a18f0694-e14d-5621-a0cd-e736598ab64d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$$72.25$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508633} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5312bb0-f9b0-5ad2-9bbb-517845ea0b67" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508881}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d7719fa6-fde6-59d2-a1a3-a59122c8717b" :question/math-academy-id "q-326544" :question/problem "An office chair is marked down by $15%$ during a promotion. What is the sale price of the chair if its original price is $$85?$" :question/worked-solution "To find an amount that's $15%$ *less than* $$85,$ we apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100%-15%=85%.\n$$\n\nWe begin by converting the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n85%=\\frac{85}{100}=0.85\n$$\n\nSo, to find $85%$ of $$85,$ we multiply $$85$ by $0.85:$\n\n$$\n0.85\\cdot $85=$72.25\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sale price of the chair is $$72.25.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229610 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229115 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7a862a80-f316-5378-86aa-83ed3e9b6bef" :knowledge-point/title "Applying a Percentage Decrease"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87621bc5-6eaa-5b6a-882b-3bef1f4439cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "72" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186227999} {:answer/id #uuid "98991be6-469f-529d-a233-ed9fc6b28adb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "68" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186228000} {:answer/id #uuid "d9a16fb4-160b-585e-b61b-4270318e4528" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "70" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186228001} {:answer/id #uuid "e66914e3-6386-5516-9016-9c264fa26d74" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "65" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186228002} {:answer/id #uuid "1f8bab44-dcf3-5c6a-8b9f-b82bc443967a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "75" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186228003}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "98991be6-469f-529d-a233-ed9fc6b28adb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "68" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186228000} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc59bc48-aec9-5220-a5f4-ccc304666d1b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186227998}] :question/difficul